 "remarks": "Welcome to the heart of SoNo, where NYC-inspired style meets the ultimate walkable lifestyle! This light-filled, modern condo features soaring 10-foot ceilings, an impressive 8-foot wall of windows, and a coveted private balcony overlooking the vibrant SoNo scene-one of only three in the building! The open-concept living space features a sleek kitchen with an oversized granite island and stainless-steel appliances, perfect for entertaining. A renovated bathroom with walk-in shower, in-unit laundry, dedicated storage, and secure covered garage parking add everyday convenience. Enjoy a secure building with its own fitness center, just steps from SoNo's buzzing restaurant scene, nightlife, theaters, waterfront, and shopping. The Maritime Aquarium, Oyster Shell Park, and SoNo Collection are all within easy reach. A commuter's dream, with Metro-North just a short walk away and I-95 and Rte. 7 just minutes from your door. Leave the car behind. Grab a coffee. Catch a train. Meet friends for dinner. This is SoNo living at its best!",
